# GLOS's colour icons (docs/gui.md 1.11): a name GLOS's programs ask for (gui_icon), and the Farm-Fresh icon it
# is (FatCow Farm-Fresh v3.92, CC BY 3.0: THIRD_PARTY.md). tools/mkicons.py (`make icons`) makes
# sdk/gui/fonts/ICONS.DAT from this list: each at 16 and at 32 pixels, in the 8-bit palette's cube.
# Icons that carry other companies' logos are not to be listed.
